<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-SPAIN PICK NEW DOUBLES COMBINATION.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SPAIN PICK NEW DOUBLES COMBINATION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Davis Cup captain Manolo Santana has changed his doubles team for next month's quarter-final against Italy in Pesaro.</p>
<p>In a bid to strengthen the weak link in the side that swept Germany to defeat in the last round, doubles specialist Francis Roig and Javier Sanchez take over from Alex Corretja and Carlos Costa.</p>
<p>Carlos Moya and Alberto Costa retain their places in the singles.</p>
</text>
